 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Rerank RAG para \"Os Sertões\" - Euclides da Cunha\n",
    "\n",
    "Este notebook implementa uma abordagem **Rerank RAG** (Retrieval + Reranking) para responder perguntas sobre o livro \"Os Sertões\".\n",
    "\n",
    "## Diferença das abordagens anteriores:\n",
    "- **Naive RAG**: Busca única por similaridade de cosseno\n",
    "- **Parent RAG**: Busca em chunks filhos, retorna documentos pais\n",
    "- **Rerank RAG**: Busca inicial ampla + **Reranker cross-encoder** para reordenar resultados\n",
    "\n",
    "## Vantagens do Reranking:\n",
    "1. **Bi-encoder** (embedding model): Rápido, busca ampla (ex: top-50)\n",
    "2. **Cross-encoder** (reranker): Preciso, avalia query+documento juntos\n",
    "3. Combina velocidade da busca vetorial com precisão do reranking\n",
    "\n",
    "## Modelos de Reranking recomendados:\n",
    "- `cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2` (inglês, rápido)\n",
    "- `BAAI/bge-reranker-base` (multilíngue, bom para português)\n",
    "- `cross-encoder/mmarco-mMiniLMv2-L12-H384-v1` (multilíngue)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Instalação de dependências\n",
    "!pip install -q pypdf sentence-transformers faiss-cpu langchain-openai langchain-community langchain-text-splitters tiktoken python-dotenv tqdm"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "import requests\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "# Download do PDF (se não existir)\n",
    "pdf_url = \"https://fundar.org.br/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/os-sertoes.pdf\"\n",
    "pdf_path = Path(\"os-sertoes.pdf\")\n",
    "\n",
    "if not pdf_path.exists():\n",
    "    print(\"Baixando PDF...\")\n",
    "    response = requests.get(pdf_url, stream=True)\n",
    "    response.raise_for_status()\n",
    "    with open(pdf_path, \"wb\") as f:\n",
    "        for chunk in response.iter_content(chunk_size=8192):\n",
    "            f.write(chunk)\n",
    "    print(f\"PDF salvo em: {pdf_path.absolute()}\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(f\"PDF já existe em: {pdf_path.absolute()}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Extração de texto do PDF\n",
    "from pypdf import PdfReader\n",
    "\n",
    "reader = PdfReader(\"os-sertoes.pdf\")\n",
    "full_text = \"\"\n",
    "page_texts = []\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, page in enumerate(reader.pages):\n",
    "    text = page.extract_text()\n",
    "    if text and text.strip():\n",
    "        page_texts.append({\"page\": i+1, \"content\": text})\n",
    "        full_text += f\"\\n--- PÁGINA {i+1} ---\\n\" + text\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Total de páginas com texto: {len(page_texts)}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Total de caracteres: {len(full_text):,}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Chunking para busca inicial (bi-encoder)\n",
    "from langchain_text_splitters import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\n",
    "\n",
    "text_splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(\n",
    "    chunk_size=800,\n",
    "    chunk_overlap=150,\n",
    "    length_function=len,\n",
    "    separators=[\"\\n\\n\", \"\\n\", \". \", \" \", \"\"]\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "chunks = text_splitter.split_text(full_text)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Manter metadados de página para cada chunk\n",
    "chunk_metadata = []\n",
    "for i, chunk in enumerate(chunks):\n",
    "    # Encontrar qual página este chunk pertence (aproximado)\n",
    "    page_num = 1\n",
    "    for pm in page_texts:\n",
    "        if chunk[:100] in pm[\"content\"]:\n",
    "            page_num = pm[\"page\"]\n",
    "            break\n",
    "    chunk_metadata.append({\"chunk_index\": i, \"page\": page_num, \"content\": chunk})\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Total de chunks: {len(chunks)}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Bi-encoder: Modelo de embeddings para busca inicial\n",
    "from sentence_transformers import SentenceTransformer, CrossEncoder\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "\n",
    "# Modelo de embeddings (bi-encoder) - rápido para busca ampla\n",
    "bi_encoder = SentenceTransformer('sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Gerando embeddings com bi-encoder...\")\n",
    "embeddings = bi_encoder.encode(chunks, show_progress_bar=True, batch_size=32)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Embeddings shape: {embeddings.shape}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Vector Store FAISS\n",
    "import faiss\n",
    "\n",
    "dimension = embeddings.shape[1]\n",
    "index = faiss.IndexFlatIP(dimension)\n",
    "\n",
    "faiss.normalize_L2(embeddings)\n",
    "index.add(embeddings.astype('float32'))\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Índice FAISS: {index.ntotal} vetores\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Salvar\n",
    "faiss.write_index(index, \"rerank_rag_index.faiss\")\n",
    "import pickle\n",
    "with open(\"rerank_rag_chunks.pkl\", \"wb\") as f:\n",
    "    pickle.dump(chunks, f)\n",
    "with open(\"rerank_rag_metadata.pkl\", \"wb\") as f:\n",
    "    pickle.dump(chunk_metadata, f)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Dados salvos.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Cross-encoder: Reranker para reordenar resultados\n",
    "# Modelo multilíngue bom para português\n",
    "reranker = CrossEncoder('BAAI/bge-reranker-base', max_length=512)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Reranker carregado: BAAI/bge-reranker-base\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Função de busca com Reranking\n",
    "def rerank_retrieve(query, initial_k=30, final_k=5):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Two-stage retrieval:\n",
    "    1. Bi-encoder: busca ampla (top-initial_k)\n",
    "    2. Cross-encoder: rerank preciso (top-final_k)\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    # Stage 1: Bi-encoder search\n",
    "    query_embedding = bi_encoder.encode([query])\n",
    "    faiss.normalize_L2(query_embedding)\n",
    "    scores, indices = index.search(query_embedding.astype('float32'), initial_k)\n",
    "    \n    " # Coletar candidatos\n",
    "    candidates = []\n",
    "    for score, idx in zip(scores[0], indices[0]):\n",
    "        if idx < len(chunks):\n",
    "            candidates.append({\n",
    "                \"chunk\": chunks[idx],\n",
    "                \"bi_encoder_score\": float(score),\n",
    "                \"index\": int(idx),\n",
    "                \"metadata\": chunk_metadata[idx]\n",
    "            })\n",
    "    \n    " if not candidates:\n",
    "        return []\n",
    "    \n    " # Stage 2: Cross-encoder reranking\n",
    "    pairs = [[query, c[\"chunk\"]] for c in candidates]\n",
    "    rerank_scores = reranker.predict(pairs, show_progress_bar=False)\n",
    "    \n    " # Combinar scores\n",
    "    for i, c in enumerate(candidates):\n",
    "        c[\"rerank_score\"] = float(rerank_scores[i])\n",
    "    \n    " # Ordenar por rerank score\n",
    "    candidates.sort(key=lambda x: x[\"rerank_score\"], reverse=True)\n",
    "    \n    " return candidates[:final_k]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Teste de busca com reranking\n",
    "test_query = \"visão de Euclides da Cunha sobre o sertão\"\n",
    "results = rerank_retrieve(test_query, initial_k=20, final_k=5)\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, r in enumerate(results):\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n--- Rank {i+1} ---\")\n",
    "    print(f\"Bi-encoder score: {r['bi_encoder_score']:.4f}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"Rerank score: {r['rerank_score']:.4f}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"Página: {r['metadata']['page']}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"Chunk: {r['chunk'][:200]}...\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Configuração do LLM\n",
    "from langchain_openai import ChatOpenAI\n",
    "from langchain_core.prompts import ChatPromptTemplate\n",
    "from langchain_core.output_parsers import StrOutputParser\n",
    "\n",
    "llm = ChatOpenAI(model=\"gpt-4o-mini\", temperature=0.1)\n",
    "\n",
    "prompt_template = ChatPromptTemplate.from_template(\"\"\"\n",
    "Você é um especialista na obra \"Os Sertões\" de Euclides da Cunha.\n",
    "Responda à pergunta baseando-se APENAS no contexto fornecido abaixo.\n",
    "Os trechos foram selecionados por um sistema de reranking de alta precisão.\n",
    "Se a informação não estiver no contexto, diga que não encontrou a informação.\n",
    "\n",
    "Contexto (trechos rerankeados):\n",
    "{context}\n",
    "\n",
    "Pergunta: {question}\n",
    "\n",
    "Resposta:\n",
    "\"\"\")\n",
    "\n",
    "chain = prompt_template | llm | StrOutputParser()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Pipeline completo Rerank RAG\n",
    "def rerank_rag(question, initial_k=30, final_k=5):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Pipeline completo Rerank RAG.\"\"\"\n",
    "    # Retrieval com reranking\n",
    "    results = rerank_retrieve(question, initial_k=initial_k, final_k=final_k)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Contexto com scores de reranking\n",
    "    context_parts = []\n",
    "    for r in results:\n",
    "        context_parts.append(\n",
    "            f\"[Rerank: {r['rerank_score']:.4f} | Página: {r['metadata']['page']}]\\n{r['chunk']}\"\n",
    "        )\n",
    "    context = \"\\n\\n\".join(context_parts)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Generation\n",
    "    answer = chain.invoke({\n",
    "        \"context\": context,\n",
    "        \"question\": question\n",
    "    })\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return {\n",
    "        \"answer\": answer,\n",
    "        \"sources\": results\n",
    "    }"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Perguntas do desafio\n",
    "questions = [\n",
    "    \"Qual é a visão de Euclides da Cunha sobre o ambiente natural do sertão nordestino e como ele influencia a vida dos habitantes?\",\n",
    "    \"Quais são as principais características da população sertaneja descritas por Euclides da Cunha? Como ele relaciona essas características com o ambiente em que vivem?\",\n",
    "    \"Qual foi o contexto histórico e político que levou à Guerra de Canudos, segundo Euclides da Cunha?\",\n",
    "    \"Como Euclides da Cunha descreve a figura de Antônio Conselheiro e seu papel na Guerra de Canudos?\",\n",
    "    \"Quais são os principais aspectos da crítica social e política presentes em \\\"Os Sertões\\\"? Como esses aspectos refletem a visão do autor sobre o Brasil da época?\"\n",
    "]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Executar Rerank RAG para todas as perguntas\n",
    "results = {}\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, q in enumerate(questions, 1):\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n{'='*80}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"PERGUNTA {i}: {q}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"{'='*80}\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    result = rerank_rag(q, initial_k=30, final_k=5)\n",
    "    results[f\"q{i}\"] = result\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f\"\\nRESPOSTA:\\n{result['answer']}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"\\nFONTES ({len(result['sources'])} chunks rerankeados):\")\n",
    "    for j, src in enumerate(result['sources']):\n",
    "        print(f\"  {j+1}. Rerank: {src['rerank_score']:.4f} | Bi-encoder: {src['bi_encoder_score']:.4f} | Página: {src['metadata']['page']}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Salvar resultados\n",
    "import json\n",
    "\n",
    "output = {}\n",
    "for key, val in results.items():\n",
    "    output[key] = {\n",
    "        \"question\": questions[int(key[1])-1],\n",
    "        \"answer\": val[\"answer\"],\n",
    "        \"sources\": [\n",
    "            {\n",
    "                \"rerank_score\": s[\"rerank_score\"],\n",
    "                \"bi_encoder_score\": s[\"bi_encoder_score\"],\n",
    "                \"page\": s[\"metadata\"][\"page\"],\n",
    "                \"chunk_preview\": s[\"chunk\"][:200]\n",
    "            }\n",
    "            for s in val[\"sources\"]\n",
    "        ]\n",
    "    }\n",
    "\n",
    "with open(\"rerank_rag_results.json\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n",
    "    json.dump(output, f, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Resultados salvos em rerank_rag_results.json\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Comparação das 3 Abordagens\n",
    "\n",
    "Após executar os 3 notebooks, você pode comparar os resultados:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Aspecto | Naive RAG | Parent RAG | Rerank RAG |\n",
    "|---------|-----------|------------|------------|\n",
    "| **Busca** | Similaridade cosseno única | Chunks filhos → Docs pais | Bi-encoder + Cross-encoder |\n",
    "| **Contexto** | Chunks pequenos (1000 chars) | Páginas completas | Chunks rerankeados (precisos) |\n",
    "| **Precisão** | Média | Boa (contexto completo) | Alta (reranking semântico) |\n",
    "| **Velocidade** | Rápida | Média | Mais lenta (2 estágios) |\n",
    "| **Melhor para** | Perguntas simples | Documentos longos/estruturados | Perguntas complexas/ambíguas |\n",
    "\n",
    "### Sugestão de uso:\n",
    "- **Naive RAG**: Baseline, prototipagem rápida\n",
    "- **Parent RAG**: Livros, documentos legais, técnicos longos\n",
    "- **Rerank RAG**: Produção, perguntas que exigem alta precisão"
   ]
  }
